<!--
    Notification small icon: the White Noise "M" mark, converted from the
    production logo SVG in the marmot-protocol/whitenoise (Flutter) repo
    (ios/Runner/production.icon/Assets/Logo.svg). It spans the canvas width
    with a 52-unit (about 1.2dp) margin. The logo's outline is drawn about
    1.6x heavier (58.5 instead of 36.9 units): the status bar draws small
    icons at 15 to 17dp, where the original outline is under 1.5px wide
    and antialiases into a blurry grey line. The outer edge moves out and
    each opening moves in by the same amount, so every opening keeps its
    shape and position. Must stay alpha-only white: the system renders
    small icons from the alpha channel and tints them itself.
-->
